      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DELIGHTFUL MIKI (3) scored two runs back before tasting defeat at her latest appearance over 2190m at Maryborough, beaten 1.5 metres into second after being on the pace throughout. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Good enough to take out a race like this. TRYX VIXEN (6) made it two wins from two runs this prep at her latest appearance over 1650m at Bendigo, scoring by 2 metres after taking charge a long way from home. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. MAXBECA (7) ended last prep with a win at Charlton over 2100m three-and-a-half months ago. Capable of a forward showing while fresh. CATIES SON (10) overcame a break to finish second, beaten 1.5 metres, over 1690m at Shepparton nine days ago. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw but he should be competitive again.",
